---
description: |
  Normalizes a Microsoft Sysmon event to OCSF 1.9. The operator first
  canonicalizes Windows Event Log XML or NXLog JSON and then maps the canonical
  record. Use `sysmon::canonicalize` and `sysmon::ocsf::map` separately for the
  staged path.
args:
  positional:
    - name: event
      type: field
      default: this
      description: A field containing Windows Event Log XML or an NXLog event.
  named:
    - name: into
      type: field
      default: this
      description: The field that receives the OCSF event.
---

$into = {source: $event}
sysmon::canonicalize $into.source, $into.sysmon
sysmon::ocsf::map $into.sysmon, $into.ocsf
$into = move $into.ocsf
